---
/**
 * CurveDigitizer — upload a screenshot of a cycle chart and recover the per-day
 * BBT and/or LH values, entirely in the browser. Handles dual-axis charts
 * (e.g. BBT on the right axis, LH on the left) via a per-series workflow.
 *
 * Emits `fertiluna:digitized` with `{ temps, lh }` (each `(number|null)[]` or
 * null) that the host page uses to fill its editable table.
 */
---

<section class="digitizer card" id="digitizer">
  <div class="dz-head">
    <h2>📷 Importer une capture d'écran</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Vous avez une courbe dans une autre appli (Inito, Premom, Clearblue,
      Flo…) ou sur papier&nbsp;? Importez une capture et FertiLuna récupère vos
      valeurs. <strong>L'image reste sur votre appareil.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="dz-mode" role="tablist" aria-label="Mode d'extraction">
    <button type="button" id="mode-auto" class="dz-modebtn active">
      ✨ Extraction auto (IA)
    </button>
    <button type="button" id="mode-manual" class="dz-modebtn">
      🎯 Calibration manuelle
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────── AUTO (IA) PANEL ─────────── -->
  <div id="auto-panel" class="dz-panel">
    <label class="dz-upload btn btn-ghost">
      Choisir une image
      <input type="file" accept="image/*" id="auto-file" hidden />
    </label>

    <p class="muted dz-hint">
      Le modèle lit automatiquement les courbes <strong>et détecte l'échelle
      (°C ou °F)</strong> — vous n'avez rien à saisir. Vérifiez l'aperçu, puis
      importez ; vous pourrez corriger chaque valeur dans le tableau.
    </p>

    <div class="dz-when-image">
      <div class="dz-stage">
        <div class="dz-canvas-wrap">
          <canvas id="auto-canvas"></canvas>
          <canvas id="auto-overlay"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dz-axes">
        <label class="dz-incl"><input type="checkbox" id="auto-temp-on" /> 🌡️ Température (BBT)</label>
        <label class="dz-incl"><input type="checkbox" id="auto-lh-on" /> 💧 LH / hormone</label>
        <span class="dz-scale" id="auto-scale"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="dz-controls">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="auto-import" disabled>
          Importer dans le tableau ↓
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="dz-status muted" id="auto-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────── MANUAL PANEL ─────────── -->
  <div id="manual-panel" class="dz-panel" hidden>
    <label class="dz-upload btn btn-ghost">
      Choisir une image
      <input type="file" accept="image/*" id="dz-file" hidden />
    </label>

    <div class="dz-when-image">
      <div class="dz-series" id="dz-series" role="tablist" aria-label="Série à extraire">
        <span class="dz-series-label">Série :</span>
        <button type="button" data-series="temp" class="dz-tab active">
          🌡️ Température (BBT)
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-series="lh" class="dz-tab">
          💧 LH / hormone
        </button>
      </div>

      <ol class="dz-steps muted">
        <li>Calibrez l'axe des <strong>jours</strong> (2 clics sur la ligne ZT/jour).</li>
        <li>Calibrez l'axe de <strong>valeurs</strong> de la série choisie — attention, BBT et LH sont souvent sur des axes <strong>opposés</strong>.</li>
        <li>Cliquez sur la <strong>courbe</strong> de cette série pour prendre sa couleur.</li>
        <li>Changez de série pour la seconde courbe, ou importez.</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="dz-prompt" id="dz-prompt" aria-live="polite"></p>

      <div class="dz-stage">
        <div class="dz-canvas-wrap">
          <canvas id="dz-canvas"></canvas>
          <canvas id="dz-overlay"></canvas>
          <canvas id="dz-loupe" class="dz-loupe"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dz-controls">
        <label class="dz-tol">
          Tolérance couleur
          <input type="range" id="dz-tol" min="10" max="120" value="45" />
          <span id="dz-tol-val">45</span>
        </label>
        <button type="button" class="btn-text" id="dz-redo">
          Recalibrer cette série
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="dz-import" disabled>
          Importer dans le tableau ↓
        </button>
      </div>

      <p class="dz-status muted" id="dz-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initDigitizer } from "../lib/digitizerUI";
  import { initAutoExtract } from "../lib/autoExtractUI";

  const root = document.getElementById("digitizer") as HTMLElement;
  const autoPanel = document.getElementById("auto-panel") as HTMLElement;
  const manualPanel = document.getElementById("manual-panel") as HTMLElement;
  const modeAuto = document.getElementById("mode-auto") as HTMLButtonElement;
  const modeManual = document.getElementById("mode-manual") as HTMLButtonElement;

  function showMode(which: "auto" | "manual") {
    const auto = which === "auto";
    autoPanel.hidden = !auto;
    manualPanel.hidden = auto;
    modeAuto.classList.toggle("active", auto);
    modeManual.classList.toggle("active", !auto);
  }
  modeAuto.addEventListener("click", () => showMode("auto"));
  modeManual.addEventListener("click", () => showMode("manual"));

  if (root) {
    // Manual calibration controller (fallback / power users).
    initDigitizer({
      root: manualPanel,
      fileInput: document.getElementById("dz-file") as HTMLInputElement,
      canvas: document.getElementById("dz-canvas") as HTMLCanvasElement,
      overlay: document.getElementById("dz-overlay") as HTMLCanvasElement,
      loupe: document.getElementById("dz-loupe") as HTMLCanvasElement,
      prompt: document.getElementById("dz-prompt") as HTMLElement,
      toleranceInput: document.getElementById("dz-tol") as HTMLInputElement,
      toleranceLabel: document.getElementById("dz-tol-val") as HTMLElement,
      redoBtn: document.getElementById("dz-redo") as HTMLButtonElement,
      importBtn: document.getElementById("dz-import") as HTMLButtonElement,
      status: document.getElementById("dz-status") as HTMLElement,
      seriesTabs: document.getElementById("dz-series") as HTMLElement,
    });

    // Auto (IA) controller.
    initAutoExtract({
      root: autoPanel,
      fileInput: document.getElementById("auto-file") as HTMLInputElement,
      canvas: document.getElementById("auto-canvas") as HTMLCanvasElement,
      overlay: document.getElementById("auto-overlay") as HTMLCanvasElement,
      status: document.getElementById("auto-status") as HTMLElement,
      tempEnable: document.getElementById("auto-temp-on") as HTMLInputElement,
      tempMin: document.getElementById("auto-temp-min") as HTMLInputElement,
      tempMax: document.getElementById("auto-temp-max") as HTMLInputElement,
      lhEnable: document.getElementById("auto-lh-on") as HTMLInputElement,
      lhMin: document.getElementById("auto-lh-min") as HTMLInputElement,
      lhMax: document.getElementById("auto-lh-max") as HTMLInputElement,
      importBtn: document.getElementById("auto-import") as HTMLButtonElement,
      onUnavailable: (reason) => {
        const s = document.getElementById("auto-status") as HTMLElement;
        s.textContent =
          reason + " Vous pouvez utiliser la calibration manuelle.";
      },
    });
  }
</script>


<style>
  .digitizer {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .dz-head h2 {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .dz-upload {
    display: inline-flex;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .dz-when-image {
    display: none;
  }
  .dz-panel.has-image .dz-when-image {
    display: block;
  }

  /* mode toggle */
  .dz-mode {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .dz-modebtn {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .dz-modebtn.active {
    border-color: var(--purple);
    background: var(--purple-soft);
    color: var(--purple);
  }
  .dz-hint {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    margin: 4px 0 10px;
  }

  /* auto-mode axis inputs */
  .dz-axes {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .dz-axis {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dz-axis legend {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }
  .dz-axis label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .dz-axis input[type="number"] {
    width: 76px;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font: inherit;
  }

  .dz-series {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .dz-series-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .dz-tab {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
  }
  .dz-tab.active {
    border-color: var(--rose);
    background: var(--rose-soft);
    color: var(--rose-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .dz-tab.done::after {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--positive);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }

  .dz-steps {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .dz-steps li {
    margin: 2px 0;
  }

  .dz-prompt {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--purple);
    min-height: 1.3em;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .dz-stage {
    display: block;
  }
  .dz-canvas-wrap {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 100%;
    overflow: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  #dz-canvas,
  #dz-overlay {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  #dz-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    cursor: crosshair;
  }
  .dz-loupe {
    position: absolute;
    display: none;
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .dz-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .dz-tol {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .dz-status {
    margin-top: 10px;
    min-height: 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
